{"shortDescription":"Welcome back to the Insider Trades series – a weekly summary of on-market ASX 200 director transactions valued at more than $10,000. The below trades have all taken place between 4 and 10 September. Directors have up to 5 business days to notify the ASX of their trades.Each week post reporting seas…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Welcome back to the Insider Trades series – a weekly summary of on-market ASX 200 director transactions valued at more than $10,000. The below trades have all taken place between 4 and 10 September. Directors have up to 5 business days to notify the ASX of their trades."]},{"type":"p","children":["Each week post reporting season has seen fewer director transactions that meet our threshold. Nonetheless, there are still some interesting insider trades to take a closer look at. The shape of the week has changed with sellers outweighing buyers: directors sold close to $14.0 million of stock against roughly $1.16 million of buying."]},{"type":"p","children":["Northern Star director buys into an activist campaign"]},{"type":"p","children":["Jeff Quartermaine bought 10,000 Northern Star shares on 4 September at an average of $23.18, the largest single director purchase of the week and his first holding in the company. Quartermaine was appointed alongside Terry Bowen as independent directors as part of the company's succession planning."]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":1},"children":["Code"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["NST"]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":1},"children":["Company"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["Northern Star Resources"]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":1},"children":["Date"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["04/09/26"]}]},{"type":"table-row","