iden dividend at its 21 August results."]},{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Maiden fully franked final dividend of 2.0cps for FY26, payable 1 October 2026 to shareholders on the register at 8 September 2026"]}]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["On-market buyback of up to $50m approved over the next 12 months, representing less than 3% of shares on issue"]}]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Closed FY26 with $454m of cash, bullion and listed investments, which comfortably funds both initiatives while leaving capacity for organic growth spend"]}]}]},{"type":"p","children":["Alkane's share price made gains the day of the result as is up a further 5% since then."]}]},"summary":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"*","children":["The value of director selling outweighed buying last week, reversing the pattern of the previous three weeks."]},{"type":"*","children":["Northern Star's Jeff Quartermaine bought while Elliott Investment Management's board campaign was running, and now chairs the subcommittee that two Elliott-endorsed appointees will join from October."]},{"type":"*","children":["Pexa directors kept buying, with both purchases made at or above the prices paid by the four directors who bought the fortnight before."]}]}]},"language":"en","tags":[{"title":"Australian stocks","args":[{"id":"category","value":"stock"},{"id":"market_country","value":"AU"}]},{"title":"Insider trading","args":[{"id":"section","value":"insider_trading"}]},{"title":"Market Index","args":[{"id":"provider","value":"marketindex"}]}],"canonical_link":"https://www.marketindex.com.au/news/insider-trades-19-asx-200-directors-bought-and-sold-these-stocks-last-week","id":"marketindex:19e664d66094b:0","title":"Insider Trades: 19 ASX 200 directors bought and sold these stocks last week","published":1789361672,"urgency":2,"link":"https://www.marketindex.com.au/news/insider-trades-19-asx-200-directors-